{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-03T10:48:42.992Z","author":"pi-toolchain-glm-1103","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"9e1c18dd119f0404d66458ad","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-03T10:48:42.992Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-03T10:48:42.991Z","author":"pi-toolchain-glm-1103","text":"Removed pm-github-version from both caller workflows (.github/workflows/pm-github-sync.yml and pm-github-closeout.yml; the closeout keeps its other inputs). The test now asserts the input is absent on both callers and that the closeout caller keeps a full-commit pin annotated with its release, replacing the old assertion that the input matched the sync pin's release comment. Classification: test pinned old CI wiring that no Dependabot bump could satisfy. Evidence: node --test test/install-pm-github.test.ts passes 5/5; the full suite npm test passes 453/453; typecheck and lint pass."}]}],"before_hash":"8d65b3fb0527961559555176f48bdd5b80406e32da6f2bb9d59f1be5059c6861","after_hash":"f7d2e4e9dec032d99dd1e4ccf2e082e6f1d1e8fe3433336191e38464ea6b387d","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"ec95d7fd82daae59d8cb7ed43f5e4aca22d52edd9f1e20887c512baddc776fad"}
